* text=auto eol=lf

*.kt text eol=lf
*.kts text eol=lf
*.xml text eol=lf
*.yaml text eol=lf
*.yml text eol=lf
*.md text eol=lf
*.pro text eol=lf

# 真机主题的测试夹具：必须逐字节原样保存。它是 CRLF，而
# ThemeKeyboardRoundTripTest 正是靠这一点证明写盘不会换掉行尾；
# 一旦被归一成 LF，那条断言会变成「同义反复」而不是「已验证」。
theme-core/src/test/resources/tongwenfeng.trime.yaml -text
gradlew text eol=lf
*.bat text eol=crlf
*.jar binary
*.png binary
*.webp binary
